  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming visit by influentials from Egypt, April 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to climate and water smart agriculture in Egypt, by connecting Egyptian young and innovative small- and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) to Dutch counterparts active in horticulture technology, knowledge and services.This will be done through related activities like:&#x2022;	Field visits to Dutch companies;&#x2022;	Attending the Africa Works conference;&#x2022;	Business-to-Business (B2B) meetings, collectively organised, and knowledge exchange.These activities will contribute to an improved knowledge of Egyptian SMEs regarding Climate and Water Smart Agriculture, and how the Netherlands can play a supporting role in that. Furthermore, the Dutch business community will be better informed of the local specificities in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
